loss rate</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10674]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>increased</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>r</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>isk of </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>talipes</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10675]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Not recommended</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10676]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Late</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>:</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>After 15 weeks.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10677]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>0.5% loss rate.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10678]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>3</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>rd</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>trimester</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10679]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Not associated with early deliver</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>y</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10680]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Bloody tap 5 \u2013 10% </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10681]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Repeat amnio 5% </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10682]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>culture failure 9.7% =&gt;more common.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10683]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Indicated when late karyotyping is need</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10684]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>USG guided</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong> amniocentesis</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> \u2013 </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10685]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>  </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>reduces bloody tapes from 2.4 \u2013 0.8%.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10686]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>  </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Use 20G, 0.9mm needle.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10687]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>   </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Routes</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10688]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Extraplacental \u2013 preferable </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10689]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Transplacental \u2013 avoid \u2013 use only if no other option</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10690]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Go through thinnest portion.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10691]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Difficulty anticipated</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10692]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Seek senior Advice who performs 100 procedures/year.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10693]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><u><strong>  </strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><u><strong>CVS:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10694]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u> Loss rate</u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>more </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>th</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>a</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>n Amnio</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>centesis</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10695]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Done at </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>10 \u2013 13</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>+6</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> weeks.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10696]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Before 10 weeks \u2013   ed risk of:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10697]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Limb reduction.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10698]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Oromandibular Hypoplasia.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10699]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Difficult to perform.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10700]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Routes:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10701]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Transvaginal</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FF0000; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>operator choice </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10702]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Transabdominal</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FF0000; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>able to </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FF0000; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'>experience</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10703]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10704]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10705]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10706]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10707]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10708]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10709]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10710]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10711]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10712]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Other risks associated with CVS and </strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>amniocentesis</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10713]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10714]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Consent:</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> (written)</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10715]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Reason for procedure.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10716]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Risk of pregnancy loss</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10717]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Accuracy &amp; limitations.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10718]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Culture failure.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10719]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Reporting time.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10720]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Need for Anti D.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10721]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Medical Advice seeking after results.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10722]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Long term sample storage.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10723]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Type of cytogenetic risk.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10724]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Twins: </strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10725]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>By trained person who is experienced in performing selective termination.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10726]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Loss rate 1%.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10727]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Careful labeling of samples &amp; Twins.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10728]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Separate needles should be used.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10729]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Transmission of infection:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10730]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>USG probe in sterile bag.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10731]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Virus screening should be done</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10732]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Viral load more reliable than antigen.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10733]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>He</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>p</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> B &amp; C =&gt; transmission limited data.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10734]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>HIV:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10735]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Delay till viral load is undetectable</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10736]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Do if Pt is on HARRT &amp; with low viral load.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10737]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>In 3</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>rd</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> more transmission risk.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10738]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>No t/m, 25% transmission, </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10739]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>with t/m, 6.1% transmission.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10740]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Use separate Gel.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10741]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Severe sepsis 1/100:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10742]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>D</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ue to</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> bowel puncture, skin contaminated, </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Gel or probe.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10743]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10744]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10745]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10746]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10747]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10748]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10749]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10750]\"